Hi! Thanks for using the group.

Your best option to see all of the node numbers is to plot the tree into a PDF with a large height.

So, something like:

=================================
# Open PDF for writing
pdffn = "whatever_name.pdf"
# Height is 30 inches
pdf(file=pdffn, width=8, height=30)

[put plotting tr + node numbers code here]

# Close PDF writing
dev.off()

# Open PDF viewing
cmdstr = paste0("open ", pdffn)
system(cmdstr)
=================================

Cheers!
Nick

